{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 🔄 FriendsBattery Operational & Role Flowchart\n`SUPER_ADMIN ➔ ADMIN ➔ SELLER ➔ EMPLOYEE`\nComplete Flow from Catalog Setup to Inventory Shipment, Counter Sale & Ledger Entry\nSource: `docs/architecture.md` · `AGENTS.md`","x":10,"y":-280,"width":1740,"height":110},
		{"id":"step_1","type":"text","text":"### 1️⃣ Catalog & Org Setup\n- **Actor:** Super Admin\n- Add Battery Brands, Models & Specs\n- Create Warehouses (`WAREHOUSE`) & Shop Locations (`SHOP`)\n- Register Shop Admins","x":320,"y":-100,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"step_2","type":"text","text":"### 2️⃣ Stock Inwarding\n- **Actor:** Super Admin\n- Register physical battery serial numbers into central `product_units` table.\n- Units initially placed in `WAREHOUSE` location.","x":960,"y":-100,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node_sa","type":"text","text":"## 👑 1. SUPER ADMIN\n**Org Root (`parent_id`: `null`)**\n- Global Warehouses & Shops\n- Product Models & Catalog\n- Global Stock & Staff GPS\n- All-Location Sales Reports","x":-170,"y":-100,"width":360,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"step_3","type":"text","text":"### 3️⃣ Dispatch & Shipment\n- **Actor:** Super Admin\n- Create shipment to transfer battery serial units from Central WH to target Shop Location.\n- Status: `IN_TRANSIT`","x":1640,"y":-100,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"step_5","type":"text","text":"### 5️⃣ Shift Start & Counter Prep\n- **Actor:** Employee / Seller\n- Employee performs **GPS Check-In** (`employee_attendance`).\n- System validates location radius.\n- Ready to serve counter customers.","x":560,"y":480,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"step_6","type":"text","text":"### 6️⃣ Customer Sale & Bill Generation\n- **Actors:** Admin / Seller / Employee\n- Select Battery Serial Number.\n- Configure Bill Extras:\n  - 🔄 Old Scrap Trade-In\n  - 🛠️ Mechanic Pricing Tier\n  - 🔌 Charging / Jumpstart / Inverter\n  - 🔄 Rental Deposit & Refund","x":1440,"y":600,"width":400,"height":270,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"step_4","type":"text","text":"### 4️⃣ Shipment Acceptance & Stock Assignment\n- **Actor:** Admin / Seller\n- Admin accepts incoming shipment at Shop.\n- Units updated to Shop Location & assigned `ownerId` to Shop Admin / Seller.","x":1360,"y":285,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node_seller","type":"text","text":"## 💼 3. SELLER\n**Seller Scope (`parent_id`: Admin)**\n- Manage Own Serial Inventory\n- Accept Admin Shipments\n- Process Customer Bills & Returns\n- Services, Scrap & WhatsApp OTP","x":-80,"y":720,"width":360,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node_emp","type":"text","text":"## 👷 4. EMPLOYEE\n**Shift Staff (`current_location_id`)**\n- Daily Check-In / Check-Out (GPS)\n- Read-Only Shop Stock & Shipments\n- Create Counter Bills\n- No Shipment Accept / Ownership Change","x":400,"y":1070,"width":360,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"step_7","type":"text","text":"### 7️⃣ Ledger Recording & Invoice Delivery\n- **System Action:**\n  - 📝 Append-Only Ledger Entry added to `inventory_transactions`.\n  - 🔋 Unit status set to `SOLD`.\n  - 📲 Send PDF Invoice via WhatsApp with OTP.\n  - 🖨️ Print physical thermal receipt.","x":960,"y":990,"width":400,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node_admin","type":"text","text":"## 🛡️ 2. ADMIN\n**Shop Admin (`parent_id`: SA)**\n- Manage Assigned Shop & Staff\n- Accept Super Admin Shipments\n- Assign Stock to Sellers\n- Shop Sales & Reports","x":-80,"y":285,"width":360,"height":240,"color":"4"}
	],
